+| DELETE | `/orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}` | offboarding → 204 |
+
+`DELETE /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}` removes the user from the members of every
+project of the organization, archived ones included, and unassigns the tasks
+assigned to them (the tasks stay). Only org admins of that organization may do
+it (403 otherwise); another organization, or a user who is not in the
+organization, is 404. The user row itself is kept.
+
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`. Request
 bodies are JSON (`Content-Type: application/json`).
 
